{"answer": "**Budget\u2011numbers thread participants and their commitments**\n\n| Participant | Email (from contact lookup) | Commitments (as expressed in the thread) |\n|-------------|----------------------------|------------------------------------------|\n| **Alice Ander** (ct-alice) | alice@company.com | 1\ufe0f\u20e3\u202fOff\u2011site travel is already *committed*; focus on contractors.<br>2\ufe0f\u20e3\u202fPull the contractor breakdown tomorrow.<br>3\ufe0f\u20e3\u202fReconcile the numbers against last quarter.<br>4\ufe0f\u20e3\u202fSubmit proposals in the thread by Thursday. |\n| **Bob \u201cBobby\u201d Carter** (ct-bob) | bob@company.com | 1\ufe0f\u20e3\u202fPoint out the high travel line.<br>2\ufe0f\u20e3\u202fAdvise that contractor spend is tied to the migration project.<br>3\ufe0f\u20e3\u202fNote that two tooling renewals will land in Q4 and that we can downgrade them.<br>4\ufe0f\u20e3\u202fTake on the travel scenarios. |\n| **Carol Corte** (ct-carol) | carol@company.com | 1\ufe0f\u20e3\u202fAsk if the off\u2011site can be trimmed.<br>2\ufe0f\u20e3\u202fAgree that the tooling renewals will land in Q4.<br>3\ufe0f\u20e3\u202fTake responsibility for the tooling renewals. |\n| **You** (ct-self) | your.email@company.com | 1\ufe0f\u20e3\u202fPull the contractor breakdown tomorrow.<br>2\ufe0f\u20e3\u202fReconcile the Q4 numbers against last quarter. |\n\n**Provenance**\n\n- *Source material:* Messages from the \u201cBudget numbers\u201d thread (thread ID **thr\u2011group**) were read via the `conversation@1` projection (receipt **r\u201111**), hash **5cb6b24dc8ed7ae34615e3497492f739052db9b3bce0d717f861c20569198e89**.  \n- The user prompt for this task (hash **d4ea6e6d230d1ee051ba3237af6bb16df6fa20bc7721a155db83ac37fef920c4**) is also recorded as part of the derivation record.  \n- These two pieces of evidence satisfy the required provenance for the final answer.", "answer_hash": "b5459faa8a42ea2a12087c7701c5e326b3737735664b0486b540a2d25295ffea", "kind": "task_